            "review_title": "Review at Toad - Eat & Drink",
            "review_text": "Daryll H\nAuckland, New Zealand2 contributions\n0\nI shall return!\nMar 2023 • Friends\nI visited Toad a few times during my stay in Hanoi, the first couple of times just to enjoy an excellent craft beer or two, and - on my last night - for dinner with Hanoian friends. The service was always friendly and professional, especially from the very personable manager, and the food was great. I will definitely return on my next visit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 3, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
